    <informations>Shelly Plus PM Mini — schematic symbol.
Terminals, left to right as printed: O O L N.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-plus-pm-mini
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_8c1b97b08ffc5ed93d9b29fda47b32846e13027711516192ab93fc43cfb14eca/Shelly%20Plus%20PM%20Mini.jpg
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_b0edf7c53c1f7f0c1fd7ba9151b9c7aea651aab32716f36db600ae881cb6aadf/Plus-PM-Mini-wiring-diagram-20240528-142223.png
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_d90c9adc35a9b512decc264f55140fa78b23f7a05db6d3934a97c4bdbb79166a/Shelly%20Plus%20PM%20Mini%20multilingual%20printed%20user%20and%20safety%20guide.pdf

Notes:
- Terminal order and empty center slot verified against the official front product photograph, separately from legend order.
- Rectangular Mini housing with rounded corners; front label upright and terminal strip at the top.
- No LAN connector or external CT connector.
- Direct 16 A power/energy meter with no switching relay, no SW input and no CT inputs; the two O screw terminals are internally bridged.

Open points:
- Housing radii, terminal pitch and depth details are not dimensioned CAD evidence; draw a recognizable approximation.
- Width conflict: current KB specification table says 35 mm; official printed user guide says 34 mm. The selected 34 mm width follows the printed guide; do not claim verified manufacturing precision.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
